{"id":"overworld-ability-effects","title":"Overworld Ability Effects","description":"Verified out-of-battle and wild encounter ability effects in Pokemon Polished Crystal","category":"core-mechanics","hero":null,"html":"<div class=\"my-6 rounded-lg border border-yellow-500/50 bg-yellow-50 p-4 dark:border-yellow-500/30 dark:bg-yellow-950/20 \" role=\"alert\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-200\">This guide has not been peer reviewed yet!</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-300\">The information presented may be incomplete, inaccurate, or represent a single perspective. Please verify critical details independently or join the Discord for community support if needed.</p></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Several abilities in Polished Crystal have effects that apply <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">outside of battle</strong> — modifying wild encounter rates, shaping which species appear, accelerating egg hatching, and rewarding items post-battle. This page documents only effects verifiable in the game&#x27;s ROM source. If an effect is not listed here, treat it as unverified.</p>\n<h2 id=\"party-effects-after-battle\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#party-effects-after-battle\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Party Effects After Battle</h2>\n<h3 id=\"pickup\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#pickup\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/pickup\">Pickup</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">After every battle, each party member with Pickup has a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">10% chance</strong> to receive an item, provided it is not already holding one. The reward is drawn from a level-scaled table via <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">GetScaledItemReward</code>, which selects from either a base or rare pool depending on the mon&#x27;s level. The in-battle effect — recovering an item the opponent consumed during the turn — is handled separately by <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">PickupAbility</code>.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/battle/abilities.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.HoneyOrPickup</code>, <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.Pickup</code>, <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">GetScaledItemReward</code>, <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">PickupAbility</code>), <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">data/items/pickup_items.asm</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"honey-gather\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#honey-gather\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/honeygather\">Honey Gather</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">After every battle, a mon with Honey Gather has a level-scaled chance to collect <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/sweethoney\">Sweet Honey</a>. The source comment gives the exact formula: <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">5% at levels 1–10</strong>, increasing by 5% per 10 levels, up to <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">50% at levels 91–100</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/battle/abilities.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.HoneyOrPickup</code>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"natural-cure\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#natural-cure\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/naturalcure\">Natural Cure</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">After battle, any party mon with Natural Cure has its non-volatile status condition automatically cleared.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/battle/abilities.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.natural_cure</code>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"egg-hatching\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#egg-hatching\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Egg Hatching</h2>\n<h3 id=\"flame-body-and-magma-armor\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#flame-body-and-magma-armor\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/flamebody\">Flame Body</a> and <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/magmaarmor\">Magma Armor</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">If at least one non-egg party member has Flame Body or Magma Armor, the egg cycle decrement applied each step is <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">doubled</strong>. The check iterates the full party and activates on the first matching ability found.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/pokemon/breeding.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">DoEggStep</code>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"wild-encounter-generation\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#wild-encounter-generation\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Wild Encounter Generation</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">All of the following effects are applied inside <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">ApplyAbilityEffectsOnEncounterMon</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/overworld/wildmons.asm</code>) before the wild encounter is finalized.</p>\n<h3 id=\"encounter-rate\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#encounter-rate\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Encounter Rate</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The lead&#x27;s ability can raise or lower the raw encounter rate:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Double rate</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/arenatrap\">Arena Trap</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/illuminate\">Illuminate</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/noguard\">No Guard</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Halve rate</strong> (minimum 1): <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/infiltrator\">Infiltrator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/quickfeet\">Quick Feet</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/stench\">Stench</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/whitesmoke\">White Smoke</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Halve rate</strong> (only when the wild mon is at least 5 levels below the lead): <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/intimidate\">Intimidate</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/keeneye\">Keen Eye</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"encounter-level\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#encounter-level\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Encounter Level</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/hustle\">Hustle</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/pressure\">Pressure</a>, and <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/vitalspirit\">Vital Spirit</a> each give a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">50% chance</strong> to push the wild mon&#x27;s level up by 1, capped at the location&#x27;s maximum level.</p>\n<h3 id=\"type-bias\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#type-bias\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Type Bias</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The following abilities give a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">50% chance</strong> to bias encounter slot selection toward a specific type:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Fire</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/flashfire\">Flash Fire</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Grass</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/harvest\">Harvest</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Steel</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/magnetpull\">Magnet Pull</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Electric</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/lightningrod\">Lightning Rod</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/static\">Static</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"personality\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#personality\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Personality</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/synchronize\">Synchronize</a> in the lead forces the wild mon&#x27;s nature to match the lead&#x27;s nature. <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/cutecharm\">Cute Charm</a> in the lead gives a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">2/3 chance</strong> to force the wild mon&#x27;s gender to be the opposite of the lead&#x27;s.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/pokemon/move_mon.asm</code> (wild mon nature and gender generation)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"wild-held-items\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#wild-held-items\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Wild Held Items</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">If the lead has <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/compoundeyes\">Compound Eyes</a> or <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/superluck\">Super Luck</a>, the probabilities for wild mon held items shift significantly:</p>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mv-exclude-content mt-6\" data-no-optimize=\"1\"><div data-slot=\"table-container\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-x-auto\"><table data-slot=\"table\" class=\"caption-bottom text-sm w-max min-w-full\"><thead data-slot=\"table-header\" class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b bg-muted\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Item 1</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">Item 2</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">No Item</th></tr></thead><tbody data-slot=\"table-body\" class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Without ability</strong></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">50%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">5%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">45%</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">With ability</strong></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">60%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">20%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">20%</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/battle/core.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">LoadEnemyWildmon</code> item assignment)</p>\n</blockquote>","titleZh":"Overworld 特性 Effects","descriptionZh":"Verified out-of-战斗 and wild 遭遇 特性 effects in Pokemon 抛光水晶","htmlZh":"<div class=\"my-6 rounded-lg border border-yellow-500/50 bg-yellow-50 p-4 dark:border-yellow-500/30 dark:bg-yellow-950/20 \" role=\"alert\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-200\">This 指南 has not been peer reviewed yet!</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-300\">The information presented may be incomplete, inaccurate, or represent a single perspective. Please verify critical details independently or join the Discord for community support if needed.</p></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Several 特性 in 抛光水晶 have effects that apply <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">outside of 战斗</strong> — modifying wild 遭遇 rates, shaping which species appear, accelerating 蛋 hatching, and rewarding 物品 post-战斗. This page documents only effects verifiable in the game&#x27;s ROM source. If an effect is not listed here, treat it as unverified.</p>\n<h2 id=\"party-effects-after-battle\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#party-effects-after-battle\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Party Effects After 战斗</h2>\n<h3 id=\"pickup\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#pickup\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/pickup\">Pickup</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">After every 战斗, each party member with Pickup has a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">10% chance</strong> to receive an 物品, provided it is not already holding one. The 奖励 is drawn from a 等级-scaled table via <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">GetScaledItemReward</code>, which selects from either a base or rare pool depending on the mon&#x27;s 等级. The in-战斗 effect — recovering an 物品 the opponent consumed during the turn — is handled separately by <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">PickupAbility</code>.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/战斗/特性.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.HoneyOrPickup</code>, <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.Pickup</code>, <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">GetScaledItemReward</code>, <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">PickupAbility</code>), <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">data/物品/pickup_items.asm</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"honey-gather\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#honey-gather\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/honeygather\">Honey Gather</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">After every 战斗, a mon with Honey Gather has a 等级-scaled chance to collect <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/items/sweethoney\">Sweet Honey</a>. The source comment gives the exact formula: <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">5% at levels 1–10</strong>, increasing by 5% per 10 levels, up to <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">50% at levels 91–100</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/战斗/特性.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.HoneyOrPickup</code>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"natural-cure\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#natural-cure\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/naturalcure\">Natural Cure</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">After 战斗, any party mon with Natural Cure has its non-volatile status condition automatically cleared.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/战斗/特性.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">.natural_cure</code>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"egg-hatching\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#egg-hatching\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>蛋 Hatching</h2>\n<h3 id=\"flame-body-and-magma-armor\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#flame-body-and-magma-armor\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/flamebody\">Flame Body</a> and <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/magmaarmor\">Magma Armor</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">If at least one non-蛋 party member has Flame Body or Magma Armor, the 蛋 cycle decrement applied each step is <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">doubled</strong>. The check iterates the full party and activates on the first matching 特性 found.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/pokemon/繁殖.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">DoEggStep</code>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"wild-encounter-generation\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#wild-encounter-generation\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Wild 遭遇 Generation</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">All of the following effects are applied inside <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">ApplyAbilityEffectsOnEncounterMon</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/overworld/wildmons.asm</code>) before the wild 遭遇 is finalized.</p>\n<h3 id=\"encounter-rate\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#encounter-rate\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>遭遇 Rate</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The lead&#x27;s 特性 can raise or lower the raw 遭遇 rate:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Double rate</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/arenatrap\">Arena Trap</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/illuminate\">Illuminate</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/noguard\">No Guard</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Halve rate</strong> (minimum 1): <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/infiltrator\">Infiltrator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/quickfeet\">Quick Feet</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/stench\">Stench</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/whitesmoke\">White Smoke</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Halve rate</strong> (only when the wild mon is at least 5 levels below the lead): <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/intimidate\">Intimidate</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/keeneye\">Keen Eye</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"encounter-level\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#encounter-level\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>遭遇 等级</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/hustle\">Hustle</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/pressure\">Pressure</a>, and <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/vitalspirit\">Vital Spirit</a> each give a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">50% chance</strong> to push the wild mon&#x27;s 等级 up by 1, capped at the 地点&#x27;s maximum 等级.</p>\n<h3 id=\"type-bias\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#type-bias\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>属性 Bias</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">The following 特性 give a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">50% chance</strong> to bias 遭遇 slot selection toward a specific 属性:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 mt-4 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Fire</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/flashfire\">Flash Fire</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Grass</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/harvest\">Harvest</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Steel</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/magnetpull\">Magnet Pull</a></li>\n<li class=\"leading-7 mt-1\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Electric</strong>: <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/lightningrod\">Lightning Rod</a>, <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/static\">Static</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"personality\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#personality\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Personality</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/synchronize\">Synchronize</a> in the lead forces the wild mon&#x27;s nature to match the lead&#x27;s nature. <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/cutecharm\">Cute Charm</a> in the lead gives a <strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">2/3 chance</strong> to force the wild mon&#x27;s gender to be the opposite of the lead&#x27;s.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/pokemon/move_mon.asm</code> (wild mon nature and gender generation)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"wild-held-items\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mt-8\"><a href=\"#wild-held-items\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Wild Held 物品</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4\">If the lead has <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/compoundeyes\">Compound Eyes</a> or <a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/abilities/superluck\">Super Luck</a>, the probabilities for wild mon held 物品 shift significantly:</p>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mv-exclude-content mt-6\" data-no-optimize=\"1\"><div data-slot=\"table-container\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-x-auto\"><table data-slot=\"table\" class=\"caption-bottom text-sm w-max min-w-full\"><thead data-slot=\"table-header\" class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b bg-muted\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">物品 1</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">物品 2</th><th data-slot=\"table-head\" class=\"text-foreground h-10 px-2 text-left align-middle font-medium [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap\">No 物品</th></tr></thead><tbody data-slot=\"table-body\" class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">Without 特性</strong></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">50%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">5%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">45%</div></td></tr><tr data-slot=\"table-row\" class=\"hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted border-b border-b-border transition-colors\"><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class=\"font-semibold inline\">With 特性</strong></div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">60%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">20%</div></td><td data-slot=\"table-cell\" class=\"p-2 align-middle whitespace-nowrap [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 items-center whitespace-nowrap\">20%</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4 text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;p:first-of-type]:mt-0\">\n<p class=\"mt-4\">Source: <code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">engine/战斗/core.asm</code> (<code class=\"bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono break-words\">LoadEnemyWildmon</code> 物品 assignment)</p>\n</blockquote>"}